<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text class="title">KTV 账单</text><text class="subtitle">拍照采集 · 智能识别 · 营业管理</text></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button class="small secondary" bindtap="settings">连接设置</button></view><view class="card" bindtap="collect"><text class="section-title">账单采集 →</text><text class="muted">选择归档日期，拍照或从相册上传多张账单。</text></view><view class="card" bindtap="manage"><text class="section-title">数据管理 →</text><text class="muted">核对账单、处理异常、查看营业统计与导出备份。</text></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{summary}}"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">今日概况</text><text class="muted">{{date}}</text></view><view class="grid"><view><text class="metric-label">有效实收（元）</text><text class="metric">{{summary.money}}</text></view><view><text class="metric-label">已复核已结账单</text><text class="metric">{{summary.settled}}</text></view></view><text class="muted">累计待复核 {{summary.pending}} 条 · 今日上传 {{summary.uploaded}} 张</text></view><view class="notice">电脑后端需要保持运行。小程序采集与数据管理共用同一份本地数据。</view></view>
